@archive 0011
@size 2

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DrGoodall
	"고맙구나, 록맨."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"네가 날 구하러 올\n거라고 믿으며 끝까지\n용기를 잃지 않았단다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"하지만… 위험한 걸\n알면서도 왜 남아\n있었니?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DrGoodall
	"반드시 끝내야만 하는 일이\n있었거든…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"걱정 마. 돌아가면 무슨 일이었는지\n모두에게 말해 줄게."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그럼 어제 일은\n웨이브 아웃해 버리자!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"하하, 좋은 생각이구나."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"좋아, 굿올.\n이제 가자."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = DrGoodall
	"좋아, 출구까지\n안내해 주렴."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"문제없어요!\n저만 따라오세요!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
